    <Major>Wave dash macro</Major>
    <Description>This macro helps Rocket League players execute advanced movement more consistently, without needing precise manual timing.

By automating a sequence that blends wavedash, powerslide, and boost, it allows smoother recoveries and better control during fast transitions.

Great for practice sessions in Free Play or for developing more reliable movement habits in the air and on the ground.

It runs continuously on its own and only requires a keyboard and mouse, with no extra configuration needed.</Description>
